{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2022-01-27 09:00:00', 'title': "ANSYS BOOSTS WISTRON CORPORATION'S 5G CELLPHONE ANTENNA DEVELOPMENT", 'text': 'PITTSBURGH, JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- / KEY HIGHLIGHTS WISTRON CORPORATION ADOPTED ANSYS SOFTWARE TO AUTOMATE ANALYSIS OF ITS 5G CELL PHONE ANTENNA APPLICATIONS ANSYS HFSS DELIVERS HIGH-FIDELITY RESULTS IN ANTENNA PERFORMANCE VERIFICATION WHILE SIGNIFICANTLY SHORTENING DESIGN CYCLES WISTRON CORPORATION, A\xa0SMART HANDHELD DEVICE MANUFACTURER, IS USING ANSYS\xa0(NASDAQ: ANSS) SIMULATION SOFTWARE TO AUTOMATE 5G CELLULAR ANTENNA POWER DENSITY ANALYSIS AND OPTIMIZE SIGNAL COVERAGE. ANSYS HFSS\xa0ENABLES WISTRON CORPORATION TO SIMULATE AND MEASURE ANTENNA PERFORMANCE FASTER THAN MORE EXPENSIVE, LOW-YIELD, INSTRUMENT-DRIVEN ALTERNATIVES.'}